                "text": "**Analyzing Color Blocks**\n\nOkay, I'm focusing on identifying connected components, specifically rectangular blocks of colors 1 and 8. Right now, I'm examining a dataset, \"Train 1,\" and have started with the top row. The initial block consists of a 3x3 rectangle of all ones, starting at coordinates (1,1). I'm looking at other blocks to understand the overall structure of this data.\n\n\n**Determining Eight Tolerance**\n\nI've been analyzing the output criteria. It seems that blocks are being kept if they have zero or one \"8\" within them. I've confirmed this with a \"Train 2\" dataset, and it appears to hold. I am now trying to formulate a general rule for eight tolerance.\n\n\n",
